{"task_id": "Mbpp/19", "solution": "def test_duplicate(nums: list[int]) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if a given array of integers contains any duplicate element.\n    Returns True if any duplicate element is found, False otherwise.\"\"\"\n    # Input validation: Ensure 'nums' is a list.\n    if not isinstance(nums, list):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input 'nums' must be a list.\")\n\n    seen = set()\n    for num in nums:\n        # Input validation: Ensure all elements are integers.\n        if not isinstance(num, int):\n            raise ValueError(\"All elements in 'nums' must be integers.\")\n        if num in seen:\n            return True\n        seen.add(num)\n    return False"}
