{"task_id": "Mbpp/88", "solution": "from collections import defaultdict\ndef freq_count(input_list: list) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the frequency of each element in a given list.\n    Returns a dictionary where keys are unique elements and values are their frequencies.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(input_list, list):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input must be a list.\")\n\n    frequency_map = defaultdict(int)\n    for element in input_list:\n        # This will raise TypeError if element is unhashable.\n        frequency_map[element] += 1\n    return dict(frequency_map)"}
