{"task_id": "Mbpp/91", "solution": "from typing import List\ndef find_substring(string_list: List[str], target_substring: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if a target substring is present in any string within a list of strings.\n    Returns True if found, False otherwise, raising TypeError for invalid input types.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(string_list, list):\n        raise TypeError(\"string_list must be a list.\")\n    if not isinstance(target_substring, str):\n        raise TypeError(\"target_substring must be a string.\")\n\n    for item in string_list:\n        if not isinstance(item, str):\n            raise TypeError(f\"All elements in string_list must be strings, found type {type(item).__name__}.\")\n        if target_substring in item:\n            return True\n    return False"}
