{"task_id": "Mbpp/171", "solution": "def perimeter_pentagon(side_length: float) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the perimeter of a regular pentagon.\n    Raises TypeError if side_length is not numeric, ValueError if negative.\"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(side_length, (int, float)):\n        raise TypeError(\"Side length must be a numeric value.\")\n    if side_length < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Side length cannot be negative.\")\n    return side_length * 5"}
