{"task_id": "Mbpp/170", "solution": "def sum_range_list(numbers_list, start_index, end_index):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of numbers in a list within a specified range.\n    Returns 0 for empty lists or effective empty ranges.\"\"\"\n\n    if not numbers_list:\n        return 0\n\n    list_length = len(numbers_list)\n    max_valid_index = list_length - 1\n\n    # Clamp indices to be within [0, list_length - 1].\n    effective_start = max(0, min(start_index, max_valid_index))\n    effective_end = max(0, min(end_index, max_valid_index))\n\n    # Return 0 if the effective start index is greater than the effective end index.\n    if effective_start > effective_end:\n        return 0\n\n    current_sum = 0\n    for i in range(effective_start, effective_end + 1):\n        current_sum += numbers_list[i]\n    \n    return current_sum"}
