{"task_id": "Mbpp/223", "solution": "import bisect\ndef is_majority(arr: list, n: int, element: any) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Determines if the given element is a majority element in the sorted array.\n    An element is a majority element if it occurs strictly more than n/2 times.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n != len(arr):\n        raise ValueError(\"Input 'n' must match the length of 'arr'.\")\n\n    if n == 0:\n        return False\n\n    first_occurrence_idx = bisect.bisect_left(arr, element)\n\n    if first_occurrence_idx >= n or arr[first_occurrence_idx] != element:\n        return False\n\n    majority_check_idx = first_occurrence_idx + n // 2\n    return majority_check_idx < n and arr[majority_check_idx] == element"}
