{"task_id": "Mbpp/786", "solution": "from typing import List, Any\ndef right_insertion(sorted_list: List[Any], value: Any) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Locates the right insertion point for a specified value in a sorted list using binary search.\n    If the value is present, the insertion point is after all existing occurrences.\n    \"\"\"\n    low = 0\n    high = len(sorted_list)\n\n    while low < high:\n        mid = (low + high) // 2\n        if sorted_list[mid] <= value:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:\n            high = mid\n    return low"}
